    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1015">

                <pb facs="0678" n="606" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg606"/>

                <head>Song Union of Zweisimmen</head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>Zweisimmen</placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-volume-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1865-07-31T23:59:59+00:34" notBefore="1865-04-15T00:00:00+00:34"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Editor</hi>: We have the honor to inform you by
                    these presents that the Song-Union of Zweisimmen, nineteen members, has this day
                    resolved to join in the address of sympathy and condolence to the free State of
                    North America.</p>
                <p>In the mean time the members take the occasion to express their distinguished
                    consideration.</p>
                <p>In the name of the society and for the president:</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>D. GEMPELER, <lb/>
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary</hi>.</item>
                            <item>F. VERRENI, <lb/>
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Actuary</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
